  "reason": "No experiments are completed yet, so the main uncertainty is whether a simple RNA-only single-profile model provides a usable performance floor. This configuration tests the most basic RNA representation, PCA, without image features, multiprofile aggregation, or fusion, giving a clean reference point for later comparisons with learned RNA encoders, multiprofile settings, image-only models, and multimodal fusion. It is the best first experiment under a limited budget because it is simple, low-confounding, and establishes an anchor without assuming that more complex multimodal models will be better."
}

